# BuildKit Dockerfile-specific .dockerignore — used in preference to the root .dockerignore
# when building with `docker build -f mayhem/Dockerfile`.
#
# Why this file exists: the upstream root .dockerignore excludes .git (line 5), which would
# strip git history from the build context.  The Mayhem spec requires git history in the image
# (§6.2 item 2: commit-image must contain the baked-in revision history so the grader and PATCH
# tier can reproduce any past build).  This file overrides the root .dockerignore, keeping .git
# while still excluding large / irrelevant directories to keep the build context lean.
#
# Do NOT add .git to this file.

# Transient / generated build artifacts (not source, not needed in Docker context)
.cache
build
mayhem-build
mayhem-standalone
mayhem-tests
vagrant

# Docker-compose overlays (unused in single-container fuzzer build)
**/docker-compose*.yml
**/docker-compose*.yaml
